==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Limited Stock}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Li'l Zyclone]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**2 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The primary strategy for this stage is to kill the first two UltraBaaBaas with the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] Cannon, before stalling the third with either [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]] or [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]]. Use this opportunity while stalling the third UltraBaaBaa to build up an unspeakably large stack of [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cats]] and/or [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naalas]], also remember to kill The Thrillerz with either [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] or [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]]. Once you're satisfied with the amount of units on the field, send out [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]] to break her Barrier. Keep in mind, you will need a fully charged Breakerblast for the boss wave, as it includes more UltraBaaBaas that serve to protect Crustaceous Scissorex.

Once the boss wave is summoned, Breakerblast the UltraBaaBaa's Barrier and let your units go to town. Regardless of who you picked to do the butchering, the stage should be over in an instant.

